  ],
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "I came back over the common with the sun going down over the pit.",
      "shot": 0,
      "at": 0.25,
      "seconds": 4.42
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Not one of them would tell me what was happening. They walked faster when I asked.",
      "shot": 1,
      "at": 6.0,
      "seconds": 4.98
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unnamed_newspaper_boy",
      "text": "The thing is moving! Screwing and screwing its way out!",
      "shot": 2,
      "at": 12.083,
      "seconds": 4.54
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "The railing I fetched Lord Hilton for was trodden flat into the sand.",
      "shot": 3,
      "at": 17.958,
      "seconds": 5.14
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "stent",
      "text": "Keep back, there! Keep back from the edge, all of you!",
      "shot": 4,
      "at": 24.208,
      "seconds": 3.98
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "They elbowed and jostled one another, and the ladies among them were the worst.",
      "shot": 5,
      "at": 29.292,
      "seconds": 4.72
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "ogilvy",
      "text": "I say! Help me keep these idiots back, will you?",
      "shot": 6,
      "at": 35.125,
      "seconds": 4.28
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "The crowd had pushed a young shopman in, and he could not climb out again.",
      "shot": 7,
      "at": 40.542,
      "seconds": 4.61
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Under the shouting I heard a humming. The end was being screwed out from within.",
      "shot": 8,
      "at": 46.458,
      "seconds": 5.36
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Then the lid came away and fell on the gravel with a ringing concussion.",
      "shot": 9,
      "at": 52.958,
      "seconds": 4.58
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Somebody blundered into me, and I came near to being pitched onto the screw.",
      "shot": 10,
      "at": 59.458,
      "seconds": 4.9
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "I think everyone expected a man to climb out of it. I know I did.",
      "shot": 11,
      "at": 65.458,
      "seconds": 5.5
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "The sunset was in my eyes. I could not make out what I saw.",
      "shot": 12,
      "at": 72.292,
      "seconds": 4.92
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "I had been so sure the thing held nothing but manuscripts and coins from Mars.",
      "shot": 13,
      "at": 78.333,
      "seconds": 5.46
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "A sudden chill came over me. Behind me a woman shrieked.",
      "shot": 14,
      "at": 85.125,
      "seconds": 4.34
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "stent",
      "text": "Get away from it! For God's sake, run, all of you!",
      "shot": 15,
      "at": 90.583,
      "seconds": 3.98
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "The weight of our whole world dragged at it, and still it came up.",
      "shot": 16,
      "at": 95.875,
      "seconds": 4.5
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "The crush behind me was gone. I stood alone at the edge, and stared.",
      "shot": 17,
      "at": 102.0,
      "seconds": 5.11
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "It toppled over the brim with a thud. Another came up out of the dark.",
      "shot": 18,
      "at": 109.125,
      "seconds": 4.67
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "A hundred yards. That was the whole distance my courage was worth.",
      "shot": 19,
      "at": 114.833,
      "seconds": 4.76
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "Nobody said anything worth hearing, and nobody moved, and nobody went home.",
      "shot": 20,
      "at": 120.708,
      "seconds": 5.3
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "kind": "narration",
      "speaker": "unnamed_first_person_narrator",
      "text": "I had an impulse to go back down for him. My fear put it down.",
      "shot": 21,
      "at": 127.333,
      "seconds": 4.94
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "speaker": "unnamed_newspaper_boy",
      "text": "He went down a long while back. Nobody has fetched him.",
      "shot": 22,
      "at": 133.792,
      "seconds": 3.61
    }
  ]
}